{"version":1,"key":"article:6","content":{"id":6,"title":"JavaScript 访问对象中的属性","author":"","content":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"2b3569fc-eb27-44b8-82d7-fa8455a4b993","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"本篇文章关于遍历对象属性的问题，包括 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"for ...in"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，"},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"Object.keys()"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，"},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"Reflect.ownKeys()"},{"type":"formatted","text":"， "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"Object.getOwnPropertyNames()"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，"},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"Object.getOwnPropertySymbols()"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 等方法及区别。"}]},{"type":"header","level":2,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","collabId":"08342997-42c9-4447-a770-c65c0eff6ef0","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"Object.keys()"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"b110719d-9f30-4c64-8106-e8826a0424bb","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"Object.keys(obj)"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 方法返回对象 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"obj"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 上所有可枚举的属性，不包括其原型上的属性"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"js","uuid":"2d50f360-a40d-46be-8067-2b3f3473d010","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"69142e32-b16b-4639-bc03-2ead1fbfc66f","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"let parent = {\n    category: 'parent'\n}\n\n// 设置 person 为 child 的原型\nlet child = Object.create(parent)\n\nchild.name = 'Alice'\nchild[Symbol('age')] = 18\nObject.defineProperty(child, 'gender', {\n    enumerable: false,\n    value: 'female'\n})\n\nconsole.log(Object.keys(child)) // [ 'name' ]","collabId":"1f93799f-64ef-417f-8a74-f5f3df3de54d","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"b762e270-f140-425d-a785-a48cf6221d07","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"需要注意的是，"},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"Object.keys()"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 无法得到键为 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"symbol"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 类型的属性。"}]},{"type":"header","level":2,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","collabId":"09466448-79f5-428f-8081-8f0195466096","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"Reflect.ownKeys()"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"43b93bdd-66ff-43c4-92a1-1b0cca938e92","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"Reflect"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 是在 ES6 中提出的，我们可以通过 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"Reflect.ownKeys(obj)"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 取得对象 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"obj"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 上所有的属性，包括不可枚举的属性以及 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"symbol"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 类型的属性，但是它不能获得其原型上的属性。"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"js","uuid":"8f75e14e-f031-4e72-ab5d-516115e4433e","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"b9400d32-ed91-414d-b1aa-2c058d1df247","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"// [ 'name', 'gender', Symbol(age) ]\nconsole.log(Reflect.ownKeys(child)) ","collabId":"6441fef6-f903-4db8-95ba-b778ff063376","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"header","level":2,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","collabId":"5bc22897-2bda-4881-8a04-1c982956ed91","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"for ... in"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"f9d0a941-c87a-455b-9b35-a6288005e3d5","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"for ... in"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 同样可以得到对象 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"obj"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 上所有可枚举的属性(不包括 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"symbol"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 类型的属性)，除此之外，它还可以获得其原型上的属性"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"js","uuid":"617f2e5c-a485-437f-9ab3-90b25acf3d5c","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"cbe66bf5-0bdb-41a6-86fe-6098a1329848","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"const keys = []\nfor (key in child) {\n    keys.push(key)\n}\nconsole.log(keys) // [ 'name', 'category' ]","collabId":"b8fb9534-5ac1-4531-8d29-5543df2fc641","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"754e86eb-3d75-44f4-9373-f31d9039f50c","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"如果希望只获得当前对象上的属性，可以通过 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"obj.hasOwnProperty(key)"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 方法进行过滤，如果 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"key"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 是 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"obj"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 上的属性，而不是其原型上的属性，则会返回 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"true"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，否则返回 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"false"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"js","uuid":"bcbde946-3ffd-4bd6-a5a7-1c8fefd55a0b","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"26f5e336-faee-4013-9ad8-16ddf484d2d9","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"const keys = []\nfor (key in child) {\n    if (child.hasOwnProperty(key)) {\n        keys.push(key)\n    }\n}\nconsole.log(keys) // [ 'name' ]","collabId":"be8d6b6c-8f94-40d5-80a0-8b82fb01c51e","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"1e190d24-6d3e-4e4e-81ec-81415e93809c","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"也可对 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"Object.keys()"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 或 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"Reflect.ownKeys()"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 进行遍历"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"js","uuid":"fe89a163-4972-4055-8c03-974176ecb06e","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"ae05dd6e-c8c9-4362-a271-795e89956ef1","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"let keys = []\nfor (key of Object.keys(child)) {\n    keys.push(key)\n}\nconsole.log(keys) // [ 'name' ]\n\nkeys = []\nfor (key of Reflect.ownKeys(child)) {\n    keys.push(key)\n}\nconsole.log(keys) // [ 'name', 'gender', Symbol(age) ]","collabId":"b064eacc-decc-4a39-83e4-8b5712268bf5","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"header","level":2,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","collabId":"d169e5a2-b84d-4941-a588-e63aa83491d0","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"Object.getOwnPropertyNames()"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"e168f493-cbdb-4667-ab55-dfc91ea229b5","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"通过 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"Object.getOwnPropertyNames(obj)"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 可以获得对象 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"obj"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 上所有类型为 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"string"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的属性，包括不可枚举的，但不包括其原型上的属性值"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"js","uuid":"f0161e7e-c215-4f4f-9dd0-fea987dde904","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"a753aa0f-8be3-4a38-b88e-43201dee011c","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"// [ 'name', 'gender' ]\nconsole.log(Object.getOwnPropertyNames(child)); ","collabId":"1980cc85-3a43-4787-a1af-615da8b04851","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"header","level":2,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","collabId":"96be52f8-9178-454b-a3b7-8db0c5ffcf5f","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"Object.getOwnPropertySymbols()"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"5e680c0b-025c-4fa2-b662-3c852424d7a1","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"通过 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"Object.getOwnPropertySymbols(obj)"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 可以获得对象 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"obj"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 上所有类型为 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"symbol"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的属性，包括不可枚举的，但不包含其原型上的属性"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"js","uuid":"5ce7bd63-2d12-4681-b705-e374e769581f","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"a85ce3e4-a9de-4e1b-8a68-0830bb804f8d","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"// [ Symbol(age) ]\nconsole.log(Object.getOwnPropertySymbols(child)) ","collabId":"11abdc93-2b0a-46f2-8c3f-224a300bd435","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]}],"tags":["for ... in","Object.keys","Reflect.ownKeys","Object.getOwnPropertyNames()"